OL,3,GNEWSA'How an app helped me retrieve my
OL,4,Astolen #40k car'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who traced and retrieved her
OL,7,Fstolen #40,000 car has said she fears
OL,8,Freprisals from the thief but is glad
OL,9,Fshe did it.
OL,11,FMother-of-four Jacinta Batalha, 35,
OL,12,Ffrom Little Hulton, Salford, was awoken
OL,13,Fat 03:00 BST on 10 August by her son's
OL,14,Fshouts and was horrified to see someone
OL,15,Fstealing her car.
OL,17,FSceptical when the police told her they
OL,18,Fwere looking for the vehicle, she was
OL,19,Finspired to search for it herself when
OL,20,Fa friend asked if the Audi had a
OL,21,Ftracker.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
